node_modules/
dist/
src-tauri/target/
cv/.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
.DS_Store

# 运行产物：每次运行的日志与失败截图不入库
logs/

# 图库与原始元数据：可由 npm run resources:update 重新生成，不入库
data/assets/
data/atlas-nice-cn.json
data/atlas-basic-cn.json
data/atlas-equip-cn.json
data/atlas-mystic-cn.json

# 截图素材：关键帧与被回放引用的故障截图入库，过程调试图不入库
captures/**/*.png
!captures/*/key/*.png
!captures/2026-11-19/07-battle-loading.png
!captures/2026-11-19-ember/01-gate.png
!captures/2026-11-19-ember/05-quest-start.png
!captures/2026-11-19-ember/34-grand-support-confirm.png
!captures/2026-11-19-ember/35-support-loading.png
!captures/2026-11-19-ember/36-attack-animation.png
!captures/2026-11-19-ember/37-ap-recovery.png

# 游戏内图像素材：不随公开仓库分发
public/assets/

# 票据同步缓存：由 npm run issues:check 从 GitHub 派生，不入库
.scratch/issue-cache/
